{"id":2190,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年5月29日下午3时，航空宇航学院在学院工会的精心筹备与组织下，于18203Z教室成功举办了“航空宇航学院青年教师教学竞赛选拔赛”。本次竞赛旨在提升青年教师教学水平，搭建教学经验交流平台，展现学院青年教师风采。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qn77pboRMRLzn7ov7QkL7Q2nN78M4M67nm62o7M2Mzf7M8l0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8nSybLSysUlCaUzAfnmTfLNQkn7QVnRW7nR7DUNrRUNVFMNM2L77bM4nFL46VLmCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/04E917AF0A8AF9A2FBDFED2DD16BECBA/6CF0A974/37E26\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qU4rpknm-PLRlYLv4CYUmL4ozNDolW67MmQ7LzMknRlPMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDMShfLky4L4UinmUDL4-8nmvDL4AkMl74o7-4UzA2MNnFnN7PL4CbnmMFU4-PLzGJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\"></p><p>比赛特邀学院教学指导委员会的原梅妮、曹咏弘、郝文乾及陈淑萍、方群玲等5位老师担任评委，全院共有21名青年教师参赛，同时吸引了9名教师到场观摩学习。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMzfp2olQfLNC8Lv4C8LNUsUl-aU4n6fozCYozUDUz9PMR-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8U1y4M1ybLlVVMzvPLlr7L77boR6Rn7CiozA7Mm67o7rFnlUZMRQ2LlrFL4CiLmUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/34B3691AE5711ED0A987CDF598D67D8E/ED846F1E/36524\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qL8lpanzCbMmf7Mvmn2MNl4UNrkLRr6fMNlaMzNbM87YLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8n1ysn1hknNLZnm6RLRGiolQfLRlPLNCDnNlPLR9PMlMFnlU8LRUaU4rFozNbLR-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\"></p><p>赛场上，21位参赛教师准备充分，以饱满的精神状态、生动流畅的教学语言和丰富充实的教学内容，赢得了评委与观摩教师的好评。整场比赛充分展现了航院青年教师良好的教学素养、教学技巧，以及勤奋刻苦、积极向上、追求卓越的精神风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qM7LpiLR-YL8VfUvNUZU4WkUzNYLz968MRG4MR9bUzM7U870gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYn1yaMYyDozG8U4ARLNCsU8MkUmMkM7Q2nzGaMRGsLlWFUlLbnlM7MmrFL87ZnR-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/52F076904C8C2F7CCBB3B4FFE004071B/AC9ECD65/3A8D2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLm-paUNMfUlr2nvzlYLzlanzLDozv6inRM7L7UDnm7iozL0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2nkyZnkhfozUYUz9PolQkUz98U46VUmMVLRGsoR9Zn7MFU8W2oRrfoznFnRr7M4UJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\"></p><p>评委们依据教案的教学目的、内容、形式、手段，课堂教学演示的教学内容、组织、效果，以及师生互动等多个维度进行现场打分与评审。经过激烈角逐，最终评选出：一等奖1名、二等奖3名、三等奖8名、优秀奖9名。评审专家还对每位参赛教师的表现进行了细致点评，提出了改进建议。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qM7LpiUzTRn7L4Uv4rRU8lao7WRL7C6ZoRU8LRUDL7lYMm-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDLkhVn1ysM8V2MNlDnRW7MmW7MRffLlUPnNrkM4vboRTFoR7bn7L8nmMFLNQRLmNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/460EF77AF6E6D2D62D40A1D1FEB77989/819DC4F3/2FC29\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qoRCpbMlUDLllaMvzLDMzG8nzv4U4v6aM7-4oRTkM4r2oRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyZLYhRMSy4Uzl8L4CiMmL4oRfkMmGsL4QVU47iLRGsLmQFLRGsnR9ZoRnFoz-aUmNJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg\"></p><p>赛后，学院副书记、工会主席张丽花对本次比赛进行了总结，她充分肯定了青年教师的出色表现，并鼓励大家以赛促教、不断提升教学能力。</p><p>此次比赛不仅让21名参赛教师在专家点评中获得了教学能力的提升，也使观摩教师深受启发，对今后的教学生涯产生了积极而深远的影响。航空宇航学院将继续秉持“以本为本、教学相长”的理念，推动教育教学质量持续提高。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qn77pboRMRLzn7ov7QkL7Q2nN78M4M67nm62o7M2Mzf7M8l0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8nSybLSysUlCaUzAfnmTfLNQkn7QVnRW7nR7DUNrRUNVFMNM2L77bM4nFL46VLmCJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmvsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10677&e=.jpg"}